# Jak 1 spin kick by spreading your arms (0.1.1 item 12; "Spin kick by spreading your arms" is off to start, so run with
# SIM_CFG=C:\JakQuest\sim\gkcfg-spread, whose OpenGOAL/jak1/settings/vr-options.txt says `spread-spin-kick 1`): to play on
